	(824, 'Your body looks worn and your spirit weary. Rest yourself beneath our roof and allow Elune to guide your dreams.', NULL, 'Euer Körper sieht geschwächt und Euer Geist sieht müde aus. Ruht Euch unter unserem Dach aus und erlaubt es Elune, Eure Träume zu führen.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ты выглядишь $gусталым:усталой;, и твой дух утомлен. Прошу тебя, отдохни у нас, и да пребудет с тобой целебная сила Элуны.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Euer Körper sieht geschwächt und Euer Geist sieht müde aus. Ruht Euch unter unserem Dach aus und erlaubt es Elune, Eure Träume zu führen.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ты выглядишь $gусталым:усталой;, и твой дух утомлен. Прошу тебя, отдохни у нас, и да пребудет с тобой целебная сила Элуны.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
