	(8238, 'Hey, $gmister:miss;.  You look like a $C with discerning tastes in wine.  I have a favor to ask, and I think I can make you an offer you can\'t refuse...forget about it!', NULL, 'Hey, $gmein Herr:meine Dame;. Ihr seht aus wie $gein:eine:c; $c, $gder:die:c; einen guten Weingeschmack hat. Ich möchte Euch um etwas bitten und denke, dass ich Euch ein Angebot machen kann, das Ihr nicht ablehnen könnt... ach, vergesst es!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Эй, $n. Ты $gпохож:похожа; на |3-3($c), $Gзнающего:знающую:c; толк в вине. Я хочу попросить тебя об одной услуге и, думаю, могу сделать тебе предложение, от которого ты не сможешь отказаться… а ладно, проехали!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(8239, 'What are you looking at, $glad : lass;?  Never seen a dwarf before, then?$B$BYou\'d best be on yer way if you don\'t want any trouble.', NULL, 'Was starrt Ihr so, $gBursche:Mädel;? Noch nie einen Zwerg gesehen?$B$BMacht Euch besser auf den Weg, bevor es hier Ärger gibt.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Чего таращищься, $gпарень:девчонка;? Что, никогда дворфа не $gвидал:видала;? $B$BНе стой на пути, если не хочешь неприятностей.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(8240, 'Ah, you must be the $glad : lass; assigned to show me around the Eversong Woods.  Took your sweet time getting here, didn\'t you?$B$BVery well, off we go.  Let us not waste one more minute.', NULL, 'Ah, Ihr müsst $gder Bursche:das Mädel; sein, $gder:das; mir zugeteilt wurde, um mir den Immersangwald zu zeigen. Habt Euch ganz schön Zeit gelassen, hier herzukommen.$B$BNun gut, lasst uns aufbrechen, und keine weitere Zeit verschwenden.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'А, ты, должно быть, $gтот самый парень, которому:та самая девушка, которой; поручили помогать мне в Лесах Вечной Песни? Не очень-то ты $gторопился:торопилась; сюда, а?$B$BЛадно, неважно. Не будем терять времени.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(8241, 'It looks like you\'ve already found love. You can give me a love token, but I\'m not giving you anything nice. I\'m waiting for someone special.', NULL, 'Man sieht gleich, dass Ihr bereits verliebt seid. Ihr könnt mir zwar ein Zeichen der Liebe geben, aber erwartet dafür kein tolles Geschenk. Das hebe ich mir für jemand ganz besonderen auf.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Похоже, ты уже $gнашел:нашла; свою любовь. Можешь дать мне знак любви, но за это тебе ничего не светит. Мне нужен кто-то особенный.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Man sieht gleich, dass Ihr bereits verliebt seid. Ihr könnt mir zwar ein Zeichen der Liebe geben, aber erwartet dafür kein tolles Geschenk. Das hebe ich mir für jemand ganz besonderen auf.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Похоже, ты уже $gнашел:нашла; свою любовь. Можешь дать мне знак любви, но за это тебе ничего не светит. Мне нужен кто-то особенный.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
