	(10562, 'We\'re always eager for more flight data!  Where do you want to go?', NULL, 'Wir freuen uns immer über weitere Flugdaten! Wohin wollt Ihr?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(10563, 'What is it then? Can\'t you see I\'m a busy dwarf?', NULL, 'Was gibt es? Seht Ihr nicht, dass ich ein vielbeschäftigter Zwerg bin?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Что еще? Ты что не видишь, что я очень занятой дворф?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(10565, 'While exploration in these new lands is no doubt important, you mustn\'t forsake Azeroth! We need you now more than ever in the fight against the Defilers. Those resources must be secured!', NULL, 'Obwohl die Erforschung der neuen Regionen zweifellos wichtig ist, dürft Ihr Azeroth nicht vergessen! Wir brauchen Euch mehr denn je im Kampf gegen die Entweihten. Die Ressourcen müssen gesichert werden!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Исследование этих новых земель, несомненно, важно, но и об Азероте забывать нельзя! Сейчас вы нужны нам еще больше в войне с Осквернителями. Сохраним же наши ресурсы!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Obwohl die Erforschung der neuen Regionen zweifellos wichtig ist, dürft Ihr Azeroth nicht vergessen! Wir brauchen Euch mehr denn je im Kampf gegen die Entweihten. Die Ressourcen müssen gesichert werden!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Исследование этих новых земель, несомненно, важно, но и об Азероте забывать нельзя! Сейчас вы нужны нам еще больше в войне с Осквернителями. Сохраним же наши ресурсы!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(10566, 'You, $c! We require your aid! The brutish Warsong orcs are destroying the wonder and beauty of Ashenvale, and we need your strength to meet them on the field of battle. Return with us to Azeroth and fight for the honor of the Silverwing Sentinels! Will you join us?', NULL, 'Ihr da, $c! Wir brauchen Eure Hilfe! Die hässlichen Orcs des Kriegshymnenklans zerstören unser schönes Eschental, und wir brauchen Eure Kampfkraft, um sich ihnen auf dem Schlachtfeld zu stellen. Kehrt mit uns nach Azeroth zurück und kämpft für die Ehre der Silberschwingen! Werdet Ihr Euch uns anschließen?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '$C! Нам нужна твоя помощь! Жестокие орки из клана Песни Войны опустошают Ясеневый лес. Нам нужна твоя сила, чтобы встретиться с ними на поле боя. Возвращайся с нами в Азерот и сразись за честь Среброкрылых Часовых! Присоединишься ли ты к нам?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ihr da, $c! Wir brauchen Eure Hilfe! Die hässlichen Orcs des Kriegshymnenklans zerstören unser schönes Eschental, und wir brauchen Eure Kampfkraft, um sich ihnen auf dem Schlachtfeld zu stellen. Kehrt mit uns nach Azeroth zurück und kämpft für die Ehre der Silberschwingen! Werdet Ihr Euch uns anschließen?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '$c! Нам нужна твоя помощь! Жестокие орки из клана Песни Войны опустошают Ясеневый лес. Нам нужна твоя сила, чтобы встретиться с ними на поле боя. Возвращайся с нами в Азерот и сразись за честь Среброкрылых Часовых! Присоединишься ли ты к нам?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(10568, 'There\'s an old saying, "Give a man a fish; you have fed him for a day.  Teach a man to fish; and you have fed him for a lifetime."  Of course, you might want to cook that fish and that is where I come in.', NULL, 'Es gibt ein altes Sprichwort: "Gebt einem Mann einen Fisch, und er ist satt für einen Tag. Lehrt einen Mann zu fischen, und er ist sein Leben lang satt." Am besten schmecken die Fische natürlich gekocht, und das ist meine Spezialität.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Есть старая пословица: "Дай кому-то рыбу, и он будет сыт целый день. Научи его ловить рыбу, и он будет сыт всю жизнь". Но рыбу еще надо приготовить, и как раз в этом я вам помогу!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
