	(10077, 'Druid? No one here follows that path... but I believe I heard of someone matching that description near the Exodar. Shalannius, I think?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Друид? Никто не следует этим путем… но мне кажется, я слышал кое о ком, подпадающем под это описание. Около Экзодара. Шаланниус, по-моему…', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Друид? Никто не следует этим путем… но мне кажется, я слышала кое о ком, подпадающем под это описание. Около Экзодара. Шаланниус, по-моему…', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(10088, 'Daedal knows his way around the art of brewing potions. He works closely with Fateema in western Azure Watch.', NULL, 'Daedal kennt sich beim Brauen von Tränken sehr gut aus. Er arbeitet eng mit Fateema im Westen der Azurwacht zusammen.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Дедал знает толк в искусстве зельеварения. Они вместе с Фатимой служат в западном подразделении Небесной стражи.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Daedal kennt sich beim Brauen von Tränken sehr gut aus. Er arbeitet eng mit Fateema im Westen der Azurwacht zusammen.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Дедал знает толк в искусстве зельеварения. Он вместе с Фатимой служит в западном подразделении Небесной стражи.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(10099, 'We have no tailors here in Azure Watch. You might try the encampment on the beach, however - they seem to have a number of tradesmen from across the sea.', NULL, 'Wir haben hier in der Azurwacht keine Schneider. Ihr könnt es jedoch bei unserem Lager am Strand versuchen. Dort soll es eine Reihe von Handwerkern von jenseits des Meeres geben.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'У нас тут, на Лазурной заставе, портных нет. Можешь, правда, попытать счастья в лагере на берегу моря – у них там бывает немало заморских торговцев.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Wir haben hier in der Azurwacht keine Schneider. Ihr könnt es jedoch bei unserem Lager am Strand versuchen. Dort soll es eine Reihe von Handwerkern von jenseits des Meeres geben.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'У нас тут, на Лазурной заставе, портных нет. Можешь, правда, попытать счастья в лагере на берегу моря – у них там бывает немало заморских торговцев.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(10089, 'We have no smithy set up in Azure Watch. However, I\'ve seen a few young blacksmiths coming from that odd encampment on the south coast. Perhaps you should investigate.', NULL, 'Wir haben hier in der Azurwacht keine Schmiede. Ich habe jedoch ein paar junge Schmiede aus diesem merkwürdigen Lager an der südlichen Küste kommen sehen. Vielleicht solltet Ihr dort nachschauen.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'У нас на Лазурной заставе кузницы нет. Но я зато видел пару юных кузнецов, что выходили из странного лагеря на южном берегу. Возможно, тебе стоит отправиться к ним.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Wir haben hier in der Azurwacht keine Schmiede. Ich habe jedoch ein paar junge Schmiede aus diesem merkwürdigen Lager an der südlichen Küste kommen sehen. Vielleicht solltet Ihr dort nachschauen.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'У нас на Лазурной заставе кузницы нет. Но я зато видела пару юных кузнецов, что выходили из странного лагеря на южном берегу. Возможно, тебе стоит отправиться к ним.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(10098, 'Travel to Stillpine Hold, my friend. The furbolgs there have been very helpful, and they might have just the expertise you need.', NULL, 'Reist zur Tannenruhfeste, mein Freund. Die Furbolgs dort waren sehr hilfreich. Vielleicht haben sie genau das Wissen, das Ihr braucht.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Отправляйся в Логово племени Тихвой, $gмой друг:странница;. Тамошние фурболги очень отзывчивы и, возможно, владеют нужным тебе мастерством.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reist zur Tannenruhfeste, mein Freund. Die Furbolgs dort waren sehr hilfreich. Vielleicht haben sie genau das Wissen, das Ihr braucht.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Отправляйся в Логово племени Тихвой, $gмой друг:странница;. Тамошние фурболги очень отзывчивы и, возможно, владеют нужным тебе мастерством.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(10091, 'Our enchanters spend their days in the Exodar, working away at any number of projects. Nahogg will start your training.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Наши зачаровыватели проводят свои дни в Экзодаре, работая над множеством проектов. Нахогг начнет твое обучение.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Наши зачаровыватели проводят свои дни в Экзодаре, работая над множеством проектов. Нахогг начнет твое обучение.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(10092, 'The local artificer, Daelo, can teach you the basics of engineering. Perhaps you can help our technician fix that malfunctioning communications device!', NULL, 'Der hiesige Konstrukteur, Daelo, kann Euch in den Grundlagen der Ingenieurskunst unterweisen. Vielleicht könnt Ihr ihm ja helfen, diese defekten Kommunikationsgeräte zu reparieren!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Местный ремесленник Даэло может обучить тебя основам инженерного дела. Возможно, ты сумеешь помочь нашему технику починить неисправное переговорное устройство!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Der hiesige Konstrukteur, Daelo, kann Euch in den Grundlagen der Ingenieurskunst unterweisen. Vielleicht könnt Ihr ihm ja helfen, diese defekten Kommunikationsgeräte zu reparieren!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Местный ремесленник Даэло может обучить тебя основам инженерного дела. Возможно, ты сумеешь помочь нашему технику починить неисправное переговорное устройство!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NU