	(12335, 'The Tauren Chieftains are staying in Silvermoon while I arrange their next tour. They often lounge on the balcony above me when they\'re not practicing. Feel free to wave... they love the attention.$B$BWe\'re not currently hiring for the show or the crew, but you can always check back later. Who knows what will arise?', NULL, 'Die Tauren Chieftains bleiben in Silbermond, während ich ihre nächste Tournee organisiere. Wenn sie nicht gerade proben, hängen sie auf dem Balkon über mir ab. Ihr könnt ruhig winken... sie stehen auf Aufmerksamkeit.$B$BIm Moment stellen wir niemanden für die Show oder Crew ein, aber ihr könnt es später noch einmal versuchen. Wer weiß, was die Zukunft bringt?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Вожди тауренов гостят в Луносвете, пока я устраиваю их следующее турне. Они часто торчат на балконе надо мной, когда не репетируют. Можешь помахать им… они любят внимание', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Сейчас мы никого не нанимаем ни для шоу, ни в команду, но ты можешь зайти попозже. Мало ли что появится…"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(12336, 'Did you manage to see their show in Terokkar Forest? It was amazing!', NULL, 'Habt Ihr ihre Show in den Wäldern von Terokkar gesehen? Die war genial!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Habt Ihr ihre Show in den Wäldern von Terokkar gesehen? Die war genial!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Die Tauren Chieftains sind bestimmt die bekanntesten Musikanten in ganz Azeroth!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Die Tauren Chieftains sind wohl die bekanntesten Musikanten in ganz Azeroth!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ich frage mich, wie lange sie wohl noch in Silbermond bleiben. Ich hoffe, dass sie hier spielen werden!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ich frage mich, wie lange sie wohl noch in Silbermond bleiben werden. Ich hoffe, dass sie hier spielen werden!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ich würde fast alles dafür geben, einmal dort oben mit ihnen reden zu können...', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ich würde fast alles dafür geben, einmal dort oben mit ihnen reden zu können...', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
	(12342, 'Schweitzer here is an old friend of mine... a valuable thing, that. Friendship, I mean. I thought I\'d forgotten the feeling until we met again in Shattrath City.$B$BHe\'s not in Tirisfal so much these days, so I thought I\'d take the Orb of Translocation here to give my hellos.', NULL, 'Schweitzer ist ein alter Freund von mir..., was nützlich ist - Freundschaft, mein\' ich. Bevor wir uns in Shattrath wieder trafen, dachte ich, dass ich das Gefühl vergessen hatte.$B$BHeutzutage ist er nicht mehr so oft in Tirisfal. Also dachte ich mir, dass ich die Translokationskugel nehmen sollte, um mal hallo zu sagen.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
