	(11960, 'All this free candy is just bad business, I tell you. Or... maybe it\'s just a loss leader... they get you in the inn, and then gouge you on the meat. It\'s brilliant!', NULL, 'Die ganzen kostenlosen Süßigkeiten sind schlecht fürs Geschäft, ich sag\'s Euch. Oder... vielleicht ist es auch nur ein Lockmittel... damit bringen sie Euch ins Gasthaus und ziehen Euch dort das letzte Hemd aus... Genial!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Die ganzen kostenlosen Süßigkeiten sind schlecht fürs Geschäft, ich sag\'s Euch. Oder... vielleicht ist es auch nur ein Lockmittel... damit bringen sie Euch ins Gasthaus und ziehen Euch dort das letzte Hemd aus... Genial!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
